<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D General Continuous-Time Diffusion Processes ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Constructing the VP Schedule from <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS3.SSS1" title="In D.3 Constructing the VP Schedule from 𝜎 ‣ Appendix D General Continuous-Time Diffusion Processes ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3.1 </span>Integrated noise budget</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS3.SSS2" title="In D.3 Constructing the VP Schedule from 𝜎 ‣ Appendix D General Continuous-Time Diffusion Processes ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3.2 </span>Linear schedule construction</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Standard Gaussian Data</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Exact Score of the Uniform + Normal Distributions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS1" title="In Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.1 </span>Equilibrium entropy <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS2" title="In Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.2 </span>Dataset entropy <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS3" title="In Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.3 </span>Squared-norm of the model score, <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{\boldsymbol{\theta}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>𝜽</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{\boldsymbol{\theta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS4" title="In Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.4 </span>Squared-difference term, <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{\mathrm{diff}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>diff</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{\mathrm{diff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS5" title="In Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.5 </span>Error sources</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A7.SS5.SSS1" title="In G.5 Error sources ‣ Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.5.1 </span>Finite-batch Monte-Carlo error</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A7.SS5.SSS2" title="In G.5 Error sources ‣ Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.5.2 </span>Time-integration (quadrature) error</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A7.SS5.SSS3" title="In G.5 Error sources ‣ Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.5.3 </span>Goodness-of-fit (modeling) error</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A7.SS5.SSS4" title="In G.5 Error sources ‣ Appendix G Numerical Estimates of Exact NLL Terms ‣ Thermodynamic Performance Limits for Score-Based Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.5.4 </span>Numerical error: floating-point and conditioning</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
